      "text": "[b,TΩ,δ] f Lp(W) ≤ [b,TΩ,δ] f − [b,TΩ] f Lp(W) + [b,TΩ] f Lp(W) b,W,Ω f Lp(W) < ∞, which takes care of the ﬁrst part of Theorem 5.1.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
